    _startingLine: '[Ask about Jeanne]'
    _dialogue:
    - _saidByPlayer: 0
      _line: Why are you asking me to exposit what you know more than I?
    - _saidByPlayer: 0
      _line: Young Jeanne grew up under this palace, Till she rose to the stage above.
    - _saidByPlayer: 0
      _line: She reached her hand to help us climb; Instead, fate pulled her six
        feet under.
    - _saidByPlayer: 0
      _line: I suspect your friend in the greenhouse shares the tragedy harder than
        I.
